uarter-final match against Kazakhstani " [:a {:href "/athletes/144769"} "Saken Bibosinov"] ". In a rematch of the 2023 World Championship final, Dusmatov took the title on a unanimous decision from Bennama. In reaching the semi-final, de Pina became the first athlete to win an Olympic medal for Cabo Verde, namely the bronze medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/136410"} "Hasanboy Dusmatov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/UZB"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/UZB.png"}] "UZB"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/142844"} "Billal Bennama"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141973"} "David de Pina"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CPV"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CPV.png"}] "CPV"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/151050"} "Junior Alcántara"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/DOM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/DOM.png"}] "DOM"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/144769"} "Saken Bibosynov"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/KAZ"} [:img {:style "pa